	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Pax et veritas in diebus nostris.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literas, quas elapsis paucis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>diebus, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> colendissime et observandissime, ad me per <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quendam baptisatum ex Israelitis una cum duobus sermonibus de <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>venerabili eucharistiae negotio misisti, grate mihi, imo gratissime <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>fuerunt.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quibus omnibus veterem inter nos amicitiam, ne in <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>oblivionem deveniat, non solum suscitas et renovas, sed et renovatam <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>observare cupis et desideras.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Illius enim animi et sententie <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>me esse novit ille, qui renum et cogitationum nostrarum et cognitor <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>et observator est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Unde observandum, quod sapientissimus Solomon <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>inter cetera Pro[verb.] 18. dixit:</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Vir amicorum, et cui cordi <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>est amicitiam edere, adsociat sibi illos et firmius adheret quam frater.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">In <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>illa ad finem usque confirmare velit nos ille, qui sapientia sua eterna et <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>amicos dei et prophetas constituit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sap. 7.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>De opusculis duobus de sacrosancto eucharistiae negotio <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>prudenter fecisti eo, quod in lingua <placeName ref="l822">Germanica</placeName> sunt excusa.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Dogma enim Luthera[norum] et concordistarum apud nos (ex<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>perto crede) nondum extincta, sed sopita iacet, unde piis viris <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>et recte sentientibus in hac re vigilandum et orandum, ne dogma <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>hoc (piis auribus indignum) maiorem incendium pareat quam antea unquam <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>extremaque peiora fiant prioribus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Videmus omnes (id quod tu scribis) <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ardere igne, ut sic dicam, inextinguibile per almam tellurem veteris nostre <placeName ref="l822">Alemani<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>e</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Alle kuͤnig, fürsten, civitates, tragt alles hüt zuo holtz und sonder<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>lich wir <placeName ref="l862">Helvetier</placeName> unsere unerkantnus und undanckperkeitt gegen gott und <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>frommen hertzlieben vatterland, wurtt <foreign xml:lang="la">Iere. a cap. 2. ad septimum usque (modo <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ad nostros mores et tempora nostra applicaverimus)</foreign> ordenlich beschriben; ex <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>wurtt ouch zuo siner zitt erfullt werden und eins nitt ussen belyben.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Contrib<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>uat <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>nobis pius pater familias alta mente ponderare, quod de verbi ministris cap. <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>6. scriptum: Excoctorem posui etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Prefectum meum, quem iubes plurimum salvere nomine tuo, 25. die iunii <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>in ripa seu torrenti... (fortassis tibi incognitum) periit.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Eligetur ergo alius iam proxima do<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>minica post Iacobi festum; - sortem arbitramur cadere super <persName ref="p4060">Ludovicum Zenhenderum</persName>, veterem prefectum a <placeName ref="l46">Biberstein</placeName>.<note type="margin">unten a.R.</note></s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Fiat, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>fiat.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">- Que attinent ad baptisatum Iudeum, admirari non possum; tot et tantas semper in promptu habet questiones et arduas quidem; impossibile esset piis et <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>doctis viris ad omnia respondere; insaciabilis responsionibus.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Dominus noster Iesus <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Christus, lux illa vera, illuminet illum hominem velamenque, quod habet, auferat ab <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>oculis suis.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/><foreign xml:lang="la">Que ad statum vite mee concernunt,</foreign> han ich mich minem lieben gott und vatter <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>empfolhet, konpt etwas widerwertigs (als taeglich hüffechtig kompt), b<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>in i<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>ch <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>i<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>ngedenck, das geschriben statt, das die letzsten ziten iren cursum also <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>muoßend han und alles erfullt werdan, das hievon Christus <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>selbst, Pau[lus], Petrus, Iudas und Iohan gesch<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>riben; troßt <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>und sterck mich der gestaltt, das ich gedultig und bestendig <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>min rast thuon mög und alwegen hieby gedencken, das <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>der herr gredtt: <foreign xml:lang="la">Petre cum tu mor esses etc.</foreign></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Der welle <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>sinen geyst und wuortt uns nuͤmer enzuͤhen, amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/><persName ref="p20696">Iosephum Altenburgerum</persName> <placeName ref="l1035">Dachssensem</placeName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurini</placeName> agri iuvenem<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>, qui statum ecclesie <placeName ref="l587">Tigurine</placeName> videndi gratia usque ad <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>te autumni temporis spatium adveniet, hunc, quem a cunnis<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">von: cunae</note> <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>educavi, cum ceteris meis observandissimis patribus et fratribus <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>commendatum habeatis.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in domino omnes.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l3">Harburgo</placeName> 25. <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>die iulii 1553.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8014">Petrus Sartorius</persName>, amicus amicorum <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>et doctorum <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>dei et Christi, domini nostri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Preclaro <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>et insigne pietatis viro <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, ecclesie <placeName ref="l587">Tigurine</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>pastori vigilantissimo et amico suo colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>